# A double-click on the lesson panel's Next moves one step, not two (docs/LEARNING.md "The
# lesson panel"; docs/BUILDING.md "Input scripts"): the second click of a double-click on Next,
# Back or Skip does nothing. Tutorial 1: step 1's Next, double-clicked, stops at step 2.
# layouts: both (also plays at 800x600: run_input_tests.py --small)
options --tutorial=first-steps --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800

wait-lesson first-steps
double-click tag:lesson:next
wait-step 2
wait 20
assert-step 2
